WEBVTT

00:01:58.916 --> 00:02:00.836
by the czarist empire.

00:02:00.876 --> 00:02:02.116
But even after that,

00:02:02.116 --> 00:02:06.436
Ukrainians remained
a separate people to a large extent,

00:02:06.476 --> 00:02:08.076
and it's important to know that

00:02:08.116 --> 00:02:11.956
because this is really
what is at stake in this war.

00:02:11.956 --> 00:02:14.076
The key issue of the war,

00:02:14.116 --> 00:02:16.356
at least for President Putin,

00:02:16.396 --> 00:02:20.756
is whether Ukraine
is an independent nation,

00:02:20.796 --> 00:02:22.516
whether it is a nation at all.

00:02:23.036 --> 00:02:27.516
He has this fantasy
that Ukraine isn't a nation,

00:02:27.556 --> 00:02:29.596
that Ukraine is just a part of Russia,

00:02:29.596 --> 00:02:31.316
that Ukrainians are Russians.